OL,3,GNEWSADrug driver struck girl, 13, then
OL,4,Ablamed seizure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver seriously injured a
OL,7,F13-year-old girl while driving under
OL,8,Fthe influence of cocaine and then
OL,9,Fclaimed a seizure caused the collision.
OL,11,FDavid Campbell, 37, who had been told
OL,12,Fby doctors not to drive because of his
OL,13,Fepilepsy, veered off the road in
OL,14,FNorthfield, Birmingham, on 3 September
OL,15,F2024, hitting a traffic light and the
OL,16,Fgirl, who was pinned against railings.
OL,18,FThe girl suffered multiple serious
OL,19,Finjuries, including a bleed on the
OL,20,Fbrain, a depressed skull fracture and a
OL,21,Ffractured spine.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
