OL,3,GNEWSADrug driver struck girl, 13, then
OL,4,Ablamed seizure
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampbell, of Bridgeburn Road,
OL,7,FBirmingham, was found to have cocaine
OL,8,Fin his system and traces of cannabis.
OL,9,FHe pleaded was sentenced to four years
OL,10,Fand eight months at the city's crown
OL,11,Fcourt.
